Pulsar Clock

The clock patch is based on pop-os/cosmic-applets by System76 and its contributors.
Upstream: https://github.com/pop-os/cosmic-applets
Tested base tag: epoch-1.9.0
Tested base commit: 82e7cd814addb0641959b634227fe550374e195b

Modifications add panel text weight, date/time separators, HEX text colors,
and in-applet controls for seconds and 12/24-hour time.

